# "Whenever another creature you control enters, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn." (CR 603.6a, 611.2). Kira is cast on turn
# 1 with a Mox Ruby, a Mox Pearl and a Mox Jet ({1}{R}{W}), and her own arrival does not pump her ("another"): she is 4/3.
# On turn 3 an Ornithopter enters, so it is 1/3 (it is 0/2) until the turn ends - the pump stays in the cleanup of turn 3, which it
# does not survive (CR 514.2): on turn 5 it is 0/2 again. No creature of Bot1's is attacking as it
# enters, so Kira's replacement does not apply and it enters untapped.

